() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Subsidizes comprehensive quality and environmental assessment \(Zero Defect,) Tj
T*
(Zero Effect\) to enhance competitiveness, reduce waste, and access bank) Tj
T*
(concessions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. All manufacturing MSMEs registered with Udyam Registration.) Tj
T*
(2. Enterprise must undertake the ZED pledge and undergo digital desktop /) Tj
T*
(   on-site verification.) Tj
T*
(3. Valid GST registration required.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Financial subsidy on certification cost: 80% for Micro, 60% for Small,) Tj
T*
(   50% for Medium enterprises. Additional 10% subsidy for women/SC/ST owned) Tj
T*
(   units. Up to Rs. 5 Lakh reward for adopting zero-pollution green) Tj
T*
(   technology, plus bank loan interest concessions \(0.25% - 0.50%\).) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 80.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 5.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
